personal information: Primary Security Objective, Confidentiality, Integrity, and Privacy. Description, customer details, employee records, and allergy notes fall here. these must comply with GDPR and HIPAA requirements, ensuring lawful processing, encryption, and user consent tracking. any unauthorized disclosure could lead to severe fines or brand damage





